(6998647, 1057479, 100495, '<td valign="top">The Queen of Darkness, Doris, materialised in the hinterworld to address her minions.<br/> <br/>"Fellow Evil," she bellowed, "in these dark and disfunctional times there are opportunities to spread our malice and hate, to turn man against man, country against country. We must grasp the opportunity to overthrow the established structures and fulfill our destiny. The first 2 phases of hate have reaped rewards, phase 3 will see us elevated to power. First we must.......oh, hang on. I think I''ve left the iron on. Back in a minute..."<br/> <br/>When Doris got home she thought she''d check her emails and then got sucked into surfing the internet and forgot about her address to the hinterworld. Phase 3 was put on hold.</td>', 'The Queen of Darkness, Doris, materialised in the hinterworld to address her minions. "Fellow Evil," she bellowed, "in these dark and disfunctional times there are opportunities to spread our malice and hate, to turn man against man, country against country. We must grasp the opportunity to overthrow the established structures and fulfill our destiny. The first 2 phases of hate have reaped rewards, phase 3 will see us elevated to power. First we must.......oh, hang on. I think I''ve left the iron on. Back in a minute..." When Doris got home she thought she''d check her emails and then got sucked into surfing the internet and forgot about her address to the hinterworld. Phase 3 was put on hold.', '2013-03-13 06:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
