(6998862, 1058165, 121949, '<td valign="top">I think you ought to be doing really well with this one but my ability to predict anything seems to be off these days. I think you will hit well with many types of audiences (just quirky enough to get the people who don''t like plain old studio shots and not so quirky as to turn of the rest) I think the lighting the pose and the look are pretty well spot on. The only thing that slightly bothers me and I don''t even know if it bothers me that much or if I am just nit picking is the light spot on her hair, I can''t decide if it adds or detracts from the overall feel of the image.</td>', 'I think you ought to be doing really well with this one but my ability to predict anything seems to be off these days. I think you will hit well with many types of audiences (just quirky enough to get the people who don''t like plain old studio shots and not so quirky as to turn of the rest) I think the lighting the pose and the look are pretty well spot on. The only thing that slightly bothers me and I don''t even know if it bothers me that much or if I am just nit picking is the light spot on her hair, I can''t decide if it adds or detracts from the overall feel of the image.', '2013-03-13 11:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
