(6999170, 1057958, 47597, '<td valign="top">Well done Keith, your first entry! (I won''t vote, only comment). If you had had more time you could have worked some photoshop on his eyes to make them more spectacular. DPC voters would appreciate that kind of thing I think.</td>', 'Well done Keith, your first entry! (I won''t vote, only comment). If you had had more time you could have worked some photoshop on his eyes to make them more spectacular. DPC voters would appreciate that kind of thing I think.', '2013-03-13 16:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
