(6999612, 1057814, 108580, '<td valign="top">Landscape not portrait :) Rules are meant to be broken but you are no doubt getting hammered. I personally like the adherence to 1. below<br/> <br/>por·trait  (pôrtrt, -trt, pr-)<br/>n.<br/>1. A likeness of a person, especially one showing the face, that is created by a painter or photographer, for example.<br/>2. A verbal picture or description, especially of a person.<br/>adj.<br/>Of or relating to the orientation of a page such that the longer side runs from top to bottom.</td>', 'Landscape not portrait :) Rules are meant to be broken but you are no doubt getting hammered. I personally like the adherence to 1. below por·trait  (pôrtrt, -trt, pr-)n.1. A likeness of a person, especially one showing the face, that is created by a painter or photographer, for example.2. A verbal picture or description, especially of a person.adj.Of or relating to the orientation of a page such that the longer side runs from top to bottom.', '2013-03-14 04:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999614, 1057973, 108580, '<td valign="top">More than just the face, but the story too...despite being in landscape orientation it does work. The use of Tungsten WB is very now.</td>', 'More than just the face, but the story too...despite being in landscape orientation it does work. The use of Tungsten WB is very now.', '2013-03-14 04:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
