(6999622, 1058044, 108580, '<td valign="top">I like that a few photographers have chosen to be OOB and not do "traditional" portrait shoots or orientation. Excellent backlighting and mood imbued in this image. Enough to show a fleeting emotion of pain and sadness. It took a while for me to notice her closed eye.</td>', 'I like that a few photographers have chosen to be OOB and not do "traditional" portrait shoots or orientation. Excellent backlighting and mood imbued in this image. Enough to show a fleeting emotion of pain and sadness. It took a while for me to notice her closed eye.', '2013-03-14 04:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
