(6999700, 1057479, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Lighting is exceptional. Details and color are great - love how the scales on the snake are tack sharp. Indeed it seems the pet owner is more fierce and threatening than the snake with that ''Don''t mess with me" expression. Just a small critique - I wish that the snake was also looking straight at us giving me the stare done like his/her owner is.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Lighting is exceptional. Details and color are great - love how the scales on the snake are tack sharp. Indeed it seems the pet owner is more fierce and threatening than the snake with that ''Don''t mess with me" expression. Just a small critique - I wish that the snake was also looking straight at us giving me the stare done like his/her owner is.', '2013-03-14 09:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999704, 1058261, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The lighting and the details are spot on with top tier work. The mood of the composition is disturbing which is different from the bulk of your other work which has those touches of whimsy and fun. To me the mood/statement is that we are prisoners not from the red tape but from the seemingly invisible constraints that squeeze upon us be it society, government, work, family, or ourselves (like issues of self-esteem or fears).</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The lighting and the details are spot on with top tier work. The mood of the composition is disturbing which is different from the bulk of your other work which has those touches of whimsy and fun. To me the mood/statement is that we are prisoners not from the red tape but from the seemingly invisible constraints that squeeze upon us be it society, government, work, family, or ourselves (like issues of self-esteem or fears).', '2013-03-14 09:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6999707, 1057055, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love how she is peeking out from the curtains. The expression is so playful! The charming smile and those big eyes just draws the viewer in. Great job!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love how she is peeking out from the curtains. The expression is so playful! The charming smile and those big eyes just draws the viewer in. Great job!', '2013-03-14 09:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
