(6999990, 1058208, 96751, '<td valign="top">The face and shadow are wonderful, but that microphone is very distracting. It''s just there, being held with any purpose than to be in the image.</td>', 'The face and shadow are wonderful, but that microphone is very distracting. It''s just there, being held with any purpose than to be in the image.', '2013-03-14 16:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
