(7000005, 1057754, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love that in spite of the blur, you can still tell he''s looking at us.</td>', 'I love that in spite of the blur, you can still tell he''s looking at us.', '2013-03-14 16:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000006, 1057894, 96751, '<td valign="top">Why is he holding it upside down?</td>', 'Why is he holding it upside down?', '2013-03-14 16:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000007, 1058261, 96751, '<td valign="top">Jeff, Jeff, Jeff.... Did it hurt when you took it off?  Strange image, yet oddly compelling. I really love the colors on this, and how you managed to create a sense of depth despite the flat white bg.</td>', 'Jeff, Jeff, Jeff.... Did it hurt when you took it off?  Strange image, yet oddly compelling. I really love the colors on this, and how you managed to create a sense of depth despite the flat white bg.', '2013-03-14 16:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000008, 1057256, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice light!</td>', 'Nice light!', '2013-03-14 16:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000009, 1057369, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so in-your-face! Caught my attention</td>', 'This is so in-your-face! Caught my attention', '2013-03-14 16:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000010, 1057968, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful moment.</td>', 'Wonderful moment.', '2013-03-14 16:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000011, 1057835, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m always torn about this type of lighting. I really like the drama of it, but in this case, I wish there was even an inkling of detail in the dark. I really do love the opposing gradient in the bg.</td>', 'I''m always torn about this type of lighting. I really like the drama of it, but in this case, I wish there was even an inkling of detail in the dark. I really do love the opposing gradient in the bg.', '2013-03-14 16:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000012, 1058243, 96751, '<td valign="top">very strange looking man</td>', 'very strange looking man', '2013-03-14 16:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000013, 1057680, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, and the soft diagonal across the image is nice</td>', 'Lovely light, and the soft diagonal across the image is nice', '2013-03-14 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000014, 1057978, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the moment, but find that the lighting accentuates the cup more than the face</td>', 'I like the moment, but find that the lighting accentuates the cup more than the face', '2013-03-14 16:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000015, 1058270, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stray hairs in portraits can be a curse, but in this case, I love them</td>', 'Stray hairs in portraits can be a curse, but in this case, I love them', '2013-03-14 16:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000016, 1058044, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great shower silhouette</td>', 'Great shower silhouette', '2013-03-14 16:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000017, 1057550, 96751, '<td valign="top">For me, this image is about a bunch of things lacking. The lighting is overly even, the bg is distracting (mostly because it is in the same tonal range as the rest of the image), and there is virtually no expression on the face. Although it is sharp, well-cropped, and yes, a portrait, it doesn''t say anything to me.</td>', 'For me, this image is about a bunch of things lacking. The lighting is overly even, the bg is distracting (mostly because it is in the same tonal range as the rest of the image), and there is virtually no expression on the face. Although it is sharp, well-cropped, and yes, a portrait, it doesn''t say anything to me.', '2013-03-14 16:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000018, 1057885, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is a seriously silly portrait, John. The eyes are captivating. Or is it the whiskers...?</td>', 'This is a seriously silly portrait, John. The eyes are captivating. Or is it the whiskers...?', '2013-03-14 16:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000019, 1058267, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stellar lighting and styling. But I''m not crazy about the overly smoothed skin (especially on her hand), and the bank of lights behind her. Seems more distracting than anything.</td>', 'Stellar lighting and styling. But I''m not crazy about the overly smoothed skin (especially on her hand), and the bank of lights behind her. Seems more distracting than anything.', '2013-03-14 16:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000020, 1058108, 96751, '<td valign="top">Just a TINY bit too much detail, but an interesting portrait</td>', 'Just a TINY bit too much detail, but an interesting portrait', '2013-03-14 16:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000021, 1058117, 96751, '<td valign="top">For me, that white border line cutting across the top of his head just kills this image</td>', 'For me, that white border line cutting across the top of his head just kills this image', '2013-03-14 16:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000023, 1057786, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, I wonder if this gentleman lives in a small French village?</td>', 'Hmmmm, I wonder if this gentleman lives in a small French village?', '2013-03-14 16:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000024, 1057983, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting color cast. I like the moment between the two, but question the inclusion of the lamp, which steals all the attention</td>', 'Interesting color cast. I like the moment between the two, but question the inclusion of the lamp, which steals all the attention', '2013-03-14 16:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000025, 1058229, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice find!</td>', 'Nice find!', '2013-03-14 16:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000027, 1058195, 96751, '<td valign="top">He looks, quite literally, bored to death</td>', 'He looks, quite literally, bored to death', '2013-03-14 16:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000028, 1058245, 96751, '<td valign="top">Another instance of impenetrable darkness. I do like that we can see both his eyes, but the absolute lack of detail in the darks, which comprise so much of the image, is not interesting to me.</td>', 'Another instance of impenetrable darkness. I do like that we can see both his eyes, but the absolute lack of detail in the darks, which comprise so much of the image, is not interesting to me.', '2013-03-14 16:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000029, 1057997, 96751, '<td valign="top">So there may be more?</td>', 'So there may be more?', '2013-03-14 16:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000031, 1057958, 96751, '<td valign="top">This child''s skin is waaaaaay too red....</td>', 'This child''s skin is waaaaaay too red....', '2013-03-14 16:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000032, 1058257, 96751, '<td valign="top">A lovely model, nice lighting, make up and wardrobe. But the psoing needs some work.</td>', 'A lovely model, nice lighting, make up and wardrobe. But the psoing needs some work.', '2013-03-14 16:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000033, 1057251, 96751, '<td valign="top">This just might be the strangest portrait I''ve seen on DPC...</td>', 'This just might be the strangest portrait I''ve seen on DPC...', '2013-03-14 16:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000034, 1058234, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space, and that the bg looks like rain, but it''s a bit overpowering, and competes with this woman''s fabulous face.</td>', 'I like the use of negative space, and that the bg looks like rain, but it''s a bit overpowering, and competes with this woman''s fabulous face.', '2013-03-14 16:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000035, 1058274, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, lovely framing with the hat brim. Not sure about the blue...</td>', 'Great lighting, lovely framing with the hat brim. Not sure about the blue...', '2013-03-14 16:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000039, 1058257, 135629, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and beautiful model. I gave this a 9, for me it would have been a 10 if her facial expression was more parallel to the ground, the eye on the left (her right) has a dimmer contrast in the white, and is less sharp in the iris than her left. But these are small suggestions for a great portrait. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great shot, and beautiful model. I gave this a 9, for me it would have been a 10 if her facial expression was more parallel to the ground, the eye on the left (her right) has a dimmer contrast in the white, and is less sharp in the iris than her left. But these are small suggestions for a great portrait. Good luck in the challenge!', '2013-03-14 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000043, 1057251, 135629, '<td valign="top">Lovely ladies, quite a different arrangement and pose, but it is splendidly done, lighting is perfect. 9</td>', 'Lovely ladies, quite a different arrangement and pose, but it is splendidly done, lighting is perfect. 9', '2013-03-14 16:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000044, 1058267, 135629, '<td valign="top">Very alternative, and stands apart from many other shots. Good lighting and focus, I gave it a 9. For me the skin is smoothed almost to the high end CG look &amp; feel over a photo, particularly the smoking hand which has a duller hue than the face and open chest areas.</td>', 'Very alternative, and stands apart from many other shots. Good lighting and focus, I gave it a 9. For me the skin is smoothed almost to the high end CG look & feel over a photo, particularly the smoking hand which has a duller hue than the face and open chest areas.', '2013-03-14 16:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000045, 1057885, 135629, '<td valign="top">Sharp right where it needs to be, an interesting, different, and eye catching B &amp; W portrait! 9</td>', 'Sharp right where it needs to be, an interesting, different, and eye catching B & W portrait! 9', '2013-03-14 16:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000049, 1058243, 135629, '<td valign="top">Great fierce portrait, has a supernatural look to it.</td>', 'Great fierce portrait, has a supernatural look to it.', '2013-03-14 16:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000050, 1057055, 135629, '<td valign="top">Very cute portrait, love the lighting, very well done. For me if the eyes/face were a bit sharper this would have been perfection.</td>', 'Very cute portrait, love the lighting, very well done. For me if the eyes/face were a bit sharper this would have been perfection.', '2013-03-14 16:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000051, 1058042, 135629, '<td valign="top">Professionally done, good lighting and DOF.</td>', 'Professionally done, good lighting and DOF.', '2013-03-14 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000052, 1057864, 135629, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait, sharp right where it needs to be, great light. And the model reminds me of the young Luke Skywalker from the original Star Wars movies (//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Luke_Skywalker.png).</td>', 'This is a great portrait, sharp right where it needs to be, great light. And the model reminds me of the young Luke Skywalker from the original Star Wars movies (//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Luke_Skywalker.png).', '2013-03-14 17:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000055, 1058229, 135629, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait, perfect lighting, focus, expression, really like this one!</td>', 'Wonderful portrait, perfect lighting, focus, expression, really like this one!', '2013-03-14 17:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000056, 1057380, 135629, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, love the colors!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, love the colors!', '2013-03-14 17:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000068, 1057924, 108580, '<td valign="top">My "portrait" shot is getting hammered because why? It''s not a full face only? Actually yes it is. I''m guessing you''re also getting low balled because it''s not a studio shoot with just a shot of your face right?<br/>I love your OOB thinking and PP so here''s an 8 at least till I revisit in 2 days.</td>', 'My "portrait" shot is getting hammered because why? It''s not a full face only? Actually yes it is. I''m guessing you''re also getting low balled because it''s not a studio shoot with just a shot of your face right?I love your OOB thinking and PP so here''s an 8 at least till I revisit in 2 days.', '2013-03-14 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000071, 1057680, 108580, '<td valign="top">I''m mesmerised by her look. Such warm and welcoming womanhood, and a subtle hint of seduction despite the shy covering of her hand.</td>', 'I''m mesmerised by her look. Such warm and welcoming womanhood, and a subtle hint of seduction despite the shy covering of her hand.', '2013-03-14 17:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000102, 1057418, 66709, '<td valign="top">This Image remind me of Waiting by E G Daily <a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=hOy8RSH5DGQ" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Waiting</a></td>', 'This Image remind me of Waiting by E G Daily Waiting', '2013-03-14 19:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000150, 1057542, 64446, '<td valign="top">Lovely high key!</td>', 'Lovely high key!', '2013-03-14 20:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000151, 1058105, 64446, '<td valign="top">Excellent characterization and execution w/ a perfect lighting.</td>', 'Excellent characterization and execution w/ a perfect lighting.', '2013-03-14 20:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000152, 1058070, 64446, '<td valign="top">What a great portrait! Love the engaging &amp; contagious subtle smile... and the panning bg makes the whole image pop!</td>', 'What a great portrait! Love the engaging & contagious subtle smile... and the panning bg makes the whole image pop!', '2013-03-14 20:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000153, 1057182, 64446, '<td valign="top">I love all the nuances of light and shadows... mesmerizing image...</td>', 'I love all the nuances of light and shadows... mesmerizing image...', '2013-03-14 20:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000176, 1058064, 114285, '<td valign="top">It''s a sweet pic Kelli, I think your suffering the same thing as me, a little too over PP, her skin is a bit too smooth.<br/> <br/>And yes she looks so grown up here! 6</td>', 'It''s a sweet pic Kelli, I think your suffering the same thing as me, a little too over PP, her skin is a bit too smooth. And yes she looks so grown up here! 6', '2013-03-14 21:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000209, 1057874, 114285, '<td valign="top">the title is worth 10 in itself, he does look like a lovely boy, this is honest and  really lovely~</td>', 'the title is worth 10 in itself, he does look like a lovely boy, this is honest and  really lovely~', '2013-03-14 21:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000306, 1058042, 140305, '<td valign="top">Already voted, just coming back to comment on my favorites. If this is in the TPL I think this should be considered cheating cuz you shouldn`t be able to use such handsome models.....I jest, of course.<br/>Love the lighting, the different textures, contrasts in light &amp; dark, composition, ok...it`s all good!! Great job and good luck!!</td>', 'Already voted, just coming back to comment on my favorites. If this is in the TPL I think this should be considered cheating cuz you shouldn`t be able to use such handsome models.....I jest, of course.Love the lighting, the different textures, contrasts in light & dark, composition, ok...it`s all good!! Great job and good luck!!', '2013-03-14 23:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000307, 1057182, 135629, '<td valign="top">So many great entries in this challenge, two of which I gave 10''s... One of which is this photo. Love the lighting, expression, pp, etc...</td>', 'So many great entries in this challenge, two of which I gave 10''s... One of which is this photo. Love the lighting, expression, pp, etc...', '2013-03-14 23:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000311, 1057857, 135629, '<td valign="top">9. Because I said so, that''s why (seems to be his thoughts) Love this shot.</td>', '9. Because I said so, that''s why (seems to be his thoughts) Love this shot.', '2013-03-14 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000313, 1058196, 135629, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9, it''s a lovely portrait. 9 only because the eyes could have been as sharp, or sharper than her bangs. Great shot though!</td>', 'I gave this a 9, it''s a lovely portrait. 9 only because the eyes could have been as sharp, or sharper than her bangs. Great shot though!', '2013-03-14 23:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
