(7000586, 1057978, 47597, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, somewhat under saturated. I bet you would get higher votes if the exact same photo had been taken with a sexy model. As it is, this pic doesn''t wow me.</td>', 'Nice tones, somewhat under saturated. I bet you would get higher votes if the exact same photo had been taken with a sexy model. As it is, this pic doesn''t wow me.', '2013-03-15 07:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
