(7001022, 1058242, 124982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect. What a pose, what great lighting, and oh my, what a cute little infant!! Just sterling!</td>', 'Absolutely perfect. What a pose, what great lighting, and oh my, what a cute little infant!! Just sterling!', '2013-03-15 18:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
