(7001400, 1058044, 103032, '<td valign="top">Different, I like it.  Like the back lighting, making a silhouette portrait.  Like the water/shower element.  Like the blue tone processing.  Different, stands out.  Very cool.</td>', 'Different, I like it.  Like the back lighting, making a silhouette portrait.  Like the water/shower element.  Like the blue tone processing.  Different, stands out.  Very cool.', '2013-03-16 17:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
