(7001574, 1058267, 124982, '<td valign="top">Well, well. You''re not messing around with this one, are you. Going for the homerun...and I think you have it. Absolutely impeccable lighting and composition. Not a fan of the plastic skin -- but I recognize that is in vogue. Fully expect this to be Top 3 at the close of voting. Quite striking! First 9 of the challenge from me.<br/> <br/>EDIT: while I think the skin is too unnaturally processed (note the hand which looks like it belongs to a mannequin), this image is head and shoulder above the rest. Such a bold image that punches harder than the others. Top vote from me.</td>', 'Well, well. You''re not messing around with this one, are you. Going for the homerun...and I think you have it. Absolutely impeccable lighting and composition. Not a fan of the plastic skin -- but I recognize that is in vogue. Fully expect this to be Top 3 at the close of voting. Quite striking! First 9 of the challenge from me. EDIT: while I think the skin is too unnaturally processed (note the hand which looks like it belongs to a mannequin), this image is head and shoulder above the rest. Such a bold image that punches harder than the others. Top vote from me.', '2013-03-17 10:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7001575, 1058243, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit and composed!! The processing is awesome too, except for the eye which looks overdone (and a wee bit creepy).<br/> <br/>EDIT..not sure if there''s a calibration difference between our monitors, or this was intentional, but the models hair is blue?</td>', 'Very nicely lit and composed!! The processing is awesome too, except for the eye which looks overdone (and a wee bit creepy). EDIT..not sure if there''s a calibration difference between our monitors, or this was intentional, but the models hair is blue?', '2013-03-17 10:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
