(7003147, 1058243, 72670, '<td valign="top">Cool looking Dude..Not sure if your intent was to oversharpen his hair oversmooth his skin but it falls short with me. THe concept and lighting setup are good ..processing I prob would have chosen a different direction</td>', 'Cool looking Dude..Not sure if your intent was to oversharpen his hair oversmooth his skin but it falls short with me. THe concept and lighting setup are good ..processing I prob would have chosen a different direction', '2013-03-19 22:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
