(7003152, 1057958, 72670, '<td valign="top">great shot! Like the angle and his gaze into the camera. HIs skin colour is pretty pink..I always have a hard time with processing skin when it is not Professionally done by a MUA beforehand..and the fact that his face and arm are so close together accentuates the difference in tones. For this I would have chosen a nice BW Conversion.</td>', 'great shot! Like the angle and his gaze into the camera. HIs skin colour is pretty pink..I always have a hard time with processing skin when it is not Professionally done by a MUA beforehand..and the fact that his face and arm are so close together accentuates the difference in tones. For this I would have chosen a nice BW Conversion.', '2013-03-19 22:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
