(7003336, 1058134, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''d chop a bit off the top and bottom, myself. The busy works for me, because of how insane the environment is, so full of things and distracting. I love the juxtaposition between him and the giant smiley face though, makes it a much more telling portrait than one might initially think.</td>', 'I''d chop a bit off the top and bottom, myself. The busy works for me, because of how insane the environment is, so full of things and distracting. I love the juxtaposition between him and the giant smiley face though, makes it a much more telling portrait than one might initially think.', '2013-03-20 01:21:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7003337, 1058013, 93565, '<td valign="top">The legs walking away really makes this one interesting. I saw it in voting but didn''t vote on anything, and am not really sure what I''d vote it as, even now. It''s unusual, surely, and somewhat provocative. I wonder if one of his legs is longer than the other, considering one platform shoe and the other totally a flat sole. Anyway, interesting shot.</td>', 'The legs walking away really makes this one interesting. I saw it in voting but didn''t vote on anything, and am not really sure what I''d vote it as, even now. It''s unusual, surely, and somewhat provocative. I wonder if one of his legs is longer than the other, considering one platform shoe and the other totally a flat sole. Anyway, interesting shot.', '2013-03-20 01:24:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7003338, 1057866, 93565, '<td valign="top">Definitely agree with Mike- way closer crop. Blow the background detail more with your 85 and focus close. Confusing with the cluttered background objects. The centered comp looks static and awkward.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-03-20 01:28:01.</i></td>', 'Definitely agree with Mike- way closer crop. Blow the background detail more with your 85 and focus close. Confusing with the cluttered background objects. The centered comp looks static and awkward.', '2013-03-20 01:27:45.000000', '2013-03-20 01:28:01.000000', 0),
(7003340, 1057473, 93565, '<td valign="top">While you did get DQ''d, I figure I''d tell you that it is possible to pull this off as a single frame, just not with the on camera flash of an s4300 because I don''t think you can do multiple flashes for each exposure (I used to own one of the precursors to this camera). If you''re ever curious how, PM me.</td>', 'While you did get DQ''d, I figure I''d tell you that it is possible to pull this off as a single frame, just not with the on camera flash of an s4300 because I don''t think you can do multiple flashes for each exposure (I used to own one of the precursors to this camera). If you''re ever curious how, PM me.', '2013-03-20 01:33:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7003341, 1058070, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyClick:</b></div><hr/><i> Such a lovely face!! I like to think the "Q" formed by his hair represents his constant "Q"uest for more information and more answers about life. Lovely OOF cape cod background. Thanks Nicky. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh sweet, shucks ;----------)</td>', 'Originally posted by PennyClick: Such a lovely face!! I like to think the "Q" formed by his hair represents his constant "Q"uest for more information and more answers about life. Lovely OOF cape cod background. Thanks Nicky.   Oh sweet, shucks ;----------)', '2013-03-20 01:33:28.000000', NULL, 0),
