(7003498, 1057182, 140305, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Mak - you''ve set the bar high captain!!!</td>', 'Congratulations Mak - you''ve set the bar high captain!!!', '2013-03-20 07:14:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7003500, 1057122, 100393, '<td valign="top">The only 10 I gave.</td>', 'The only 10 I gave.', '2013-03-20 07:17:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7003501, 1057894, 153814, '<td valign="top">WOW well done Rian.</td>', 'WOW well done Rian.', '2013-03-20 07:18:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7003521, 1058261, 29658, '<td valign="top">This is ridicolous... How can somebody vote this picture less than a 5? I gave you a 9. This is technically perfect and also creative. I always think that scores below 5 should be for pictures which have bad composition or some sort of technical mistake, but an average good composed and exposed shot with no mistakes shouldn''t get less than a 5. I think this site is losing the original intent which was to provide constructive comments (especially if you''re ranking 4 and below - EXPLAIN WHY AND HOW TO IMPROVE!!!) and there are some secondary reasons for such votes.<br/> <br/>This should have ribboned. My 2 cents.</td>', 'This is ridicolous... How can somebody vote this picture less than a 5? I gave you a 9. This is technically perfect and also creative. I always think that scores below 5 should be for pictures which have bad composition or some sort of technical mistake, but an average good composed and exposed shot with no mistakes shouldn''t get less than a 5. I think this site is losing the original intent which was to provide constructive comments (especially if you''re ranking 4 and below - EXPLAIN WHY AND HOW TO IMPROVE!!!) and there are some secondary reasons for such votes. This should have ribboned. My 2 cents.', '2013-03-20 07:55:18.000000', NULL, 0),
