(7003615, 1058242, 121949, '<td valign="top">I think you got hit with the baby haters votes. This should have done better, it was one of my picks for the top 5.</td>', 'I think you got hit with the baby haters votes. This should have done better, it was one of my picks for the top 5.', '2013-03-20 10:06:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7003616, 1057864, 82999, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by h2:</b></div><hr/><i> I didn''t vote on this one, probably would have given a 6. I like the background and composition, focus is spot on, tonal range is very good. Overall good portrait, just nothing special. I find the lighting to be quite standard-ish and uninteresting. <br/>You might feel different, but your biased - I don''t get an emotional response from this portrait, there''s neither drama nor happiness conveyed; it looks like what it is - staged. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That was my sentiment and I did give it a 6. I thought about changing my vote on this one more than once, but ultimately left it at 6 for the reasons stated by H2.  Everything about the portrait is technically very good.  Both the subject and the expression were just boring. <br/> <br/>If there had been any quirkiness, grit, laughter, unusual pose, I would have likely scored it higher.</td>', 'Originally posted by h2: I didn''t vote on this one, probably would have given a 6. I like the background and composition, focus is spot on, tonal range is very good. Overall good portrait, just nothing special. I find the lighting to be quite standard-ish and uninteresting. You might feel different, but your biased - I don''t get an emotional response from this portrait, there''s neither drama nor happiness conveyed; it looks like what it is - staged.   That was my sentiment and I did give it a 6. I thought about changing my vote on this one more than once, but ultimately left it at 6 for the reasons stated by H2.  Everything about the portrait is technically very good.  Both the subject and the expression were just boring.  If there had been any quirkiness, grit, laughter, unusual pose, I would have likely scored it higher.', '2013-03-20 10:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
