(7003652, 1058138, 10686, '<td valign="top">I can''t add much to what''s been said already. The lighting on the subject''s right is too strong, the left side of his hair and the black part of his uniform have melted into the black BG and the main light is emphasizing the jersey, not his face. The pose is OK, but I don''t feel qualified to offer advice there. I think the crop here is a bit too tight, but it''s not terrible.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-03-20 10:34:24.</i></td>', 'I can''t add much to what''s been said already. The lighting on the subject''s right is too strong, the left side of his hair and the black part of his uniform have melted into the black BG and the main light is emphasizing the jersey, not his face. The pose is OK, but I don''t feel qualified to offer advice there. I think the crop here is a bit too tight, but it''s not terrible.', '2013-03-20 10:34:11.000000', '2013-03-20 10:34:24.000000', 0),
