(7003674, 1057864, 124982, '<td valign="top">I liked the focus and composition. Lighting was a little flat for my liking. If that was a little more dramatic, I would''ve scored it higher than the 6 I gave.</td>', 'I liked the focus and composition. Lighting was a little flat for my liking. If that was a little more dramatic, I would''ve scored it higher than the 6 I gave.', '2013-03-20 10:51:05.000000', NULL, 0),
